          "targetDoi": "10.1063/1.2396893",
          "snippet": "Knowledge of the stiffness of the optical trap and measurement of the micro-sphere's displacement from its equilibrium position enables the force exerted on the micro-sphere to be calculated. A single silica micro-sphere (Bang Laboratories Ltd, 5.20 lm mean diameter, variance 10%-15%, and density 2.0 g/cm 3 ) was trapped at the focus of the laser. The particle's motion was measured at 150 frames/s using image tracking.",
