          "targetDoi": "10.1063/1.4769092",
          "snippet": "24,25 In this work, we use the device for onedimensional trapping by driving a pair of oppositely mounted piezoelectric transducers to create a parallel set of acoustic pressure nodal planes throughout the sample (see Figure 1). The acoustic trap positions can be controlled in x by adjusting the relative phase of the transducers.",
